; fixtures/import/sort/already-sorted.journal
;
; Every construct the other fixtures use, already in date order. Sorting this
; must be the exact identity: the same bytes, not merely an equivalent file.

account assets:bank:checking
account expenses:groceries
account income:salary
commodity $1,000.00

; The first paycheck of the year.
2026-01-28 Paycheck
    assets:bank:checking    $2,400.00
    income:salary

2026-02-03 Grocery store
    expenses:groceries         $52.10
    assets:bank:checking

comment
Anything at all may live in here, including a line that looks exactly like
2026-01-01 a transaction
    that is out of order.
end comment

2026-02-07 Grocery store
    expenses:groceries         $18.75
    assets:bank:checking
